=== hash-pair-value-rw-hash-pairs
from: CSS::Properties 0.10.9 lib/CSS/Properties.rakumod:562
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method value
--- code
my %props = width => '10', height => '4';
sub coercer($v) { $v ~ 'px' }
for %props.pairs -> \p {
    p.value = coercer p.value;
}
say %props.sort.map(*.gist).join(' ');
--- expect
height => 4px width => 10px

